Comment: 0,0:01:47.21,0:01:47.21,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.22,0:02:04.02,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whoa! It’s already started!{BG: irasshai! Welcome! just before scene switches}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.40,0:02:08.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Look! So much tasty-looking stuff!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.69,0:02:10.32,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon, what should we get?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.32,0:02:13.36,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hold it! We gotta be \N sponsor-ble{responsible} with money, right?{katakana like he barely knows the word, just the phrase to repeat it without understanding the meaning}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.16,0:02:15.57,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,This is awesome.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.57,0:02:18.62,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,The festival mood’s reached \N every corner of Table City.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.49,0:02:21.04,Main,Nemo,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.00,0:02:23.50,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Nemo!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.50,0:02:26.25,Main,Nemo,0,0,0,,Haven’t seen you since Rakua! \N Been doing well?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.25,0:02:29.88,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Yeah. We’ve been all over since then!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.88,0:02:33.63,Main,Nemo,0,0,0,,That’s great to hear! \N Bearing fruit again, eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.26,0:02:38.14,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Thank you for inviting us to \N the Orange Academy School Festival!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.14,0:02:40.64,Main,Nemo,0,0,0,,Well, it only comes once a year, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.64,0:02:42.85,Main,Nemo,0,0,0,,So have lots of fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.48,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Nemo-senpai!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.48,0:02:46.65,Main,Student,0,0,0,,The heat for our stall stopped working!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.65,0:02:51.15,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Our speaker isn’t working! \N Can you take a look?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.15,0:02:52.03,Main,Nemo,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.07,0:02:54.36,Main,Nemo,0,0,0,,Well, see you around.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.36,0:02:55.15,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.99,0:02:59.28,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Being head of the student council’s \N gotta keep you busy. {Must be busy, being the head of the student council.}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.28,0:03:03.00,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Botan says she’s inside, \N so let’s go check on her.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.51,0:03:14.22,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Here, try this.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.51,0:03:14.22,Main,Student,0,0,0,,{\an8}Welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.26,0:03:19.39,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Welcome to the House of Divination.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.93,0:03:24.52,Main,Student,0,0,0,,We’re holding a Ghost Pokémon exhibit \N on the third floor!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.73,0:03:30.02,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Excuse u—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.90,0:03:38.28,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Eeek!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.28,0:03:40.12,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.74,0:03:43.54,Main,Shuumei,0,0,0,,Nin-nin. What’s the trouble?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.54,0:03:46.29,Main,Piña,0,0,0,,Not cool, Biwa-chan. \N Scaring a girl like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.29,0:03:48.71,Main,Ortiga,0,0,0,,Sorry, miss.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.71,0:03:50.79,Main,Meloco,0,0,0,,We’re good guys, so don’t worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.84,0:03:57.05,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,Welcome to Team Star!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.43,0:04:01.30,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,It’s been forever. \N Good to see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.30,0:04:02.68,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Same for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.68,0:04:06.06,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi! I’m a Rising Voltteccer!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.44,0:04:10.31,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,I’m Botan. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.31,0:04:12.61,Main,Piña,0,0,0,,We’ve heard all about you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.61,0:04:13.73,Main,Piña,0,0,0,,I’m Piña.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.73,0:04:15.90,Main,Piña,0,0,0,,Feel free to chill out \N and kick back.{A guy who conjugates the English word chill out, huh}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.28,0:04:19.95,Main,Ortiga,0,0,0,,Ortiga.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.95,0:04:22.91,Main,Ortiga,0,0,0,,This’s my super-cute Bowtzel!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.04,0:04:25.66,Main,Biwa,0,0,0,,I’m Biwa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.66,0:04:28.37,Main,Biwa,0,0,0,,It’s so cool to meet \N all Botan-chan’s friends!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.46,0:04:31.92,Main,Meloco,0,0,0,,An’ I’m Meloco.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.92,0:04:35.59,Main,Meloco,0,0,0,,You got “tough” written all over yer faces. \N No wonder the boss digs ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.80,0:04:40.34,Main,Shuumei,0,0,0,,Mine name is Shuumei. \N Pleased to make thy acquaintance.{Mixes fancy words: Old-timey Japanese, and fancy English words like "you"}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.72,0:04:44.64,Main,Piña,0,0,0,,Introductions all done!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.64,0:04:47.35,Main,Them,0,0,0,,{\i1}Starrific work!{\i0}{otsukaresamadesutar!}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.27,0:04:50.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What a...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.44,0:04:52.44,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,...colorful bunch.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.44,0:04:57.82,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,A lot of stuff went down not too long ago, \N and we’d already given up these costumes...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.82,0:05:02.45,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,But it’s the school festival and all, \N so we decided we’d wear them in the parade.{dashi}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.45,0:05:04.53,Main,Meloco,0,0,0,,Dressin’ like this again \N is embarrassin’...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.53,0:05:05.83,Main,Biwa,0,0,0,,It’s so nostalgic!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.33,0:05:07.70,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,A parade?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.70,0:05:11.25,Main,Piña,0,0,0,,The main event \N during the school festival’s finale!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.25,0:05:17.51,Main,Ortiga,0,0,0,,Dressed up in all sorts of costumes, \N students and Pokémon march across Table City!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.51,0:05:20.01,Main,Meloco,0,0,0,,We’re preppin’ for it right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.01,0:05:20.93,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s lovely!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.93,0:05:21.84,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I wanna see it!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.84,0:05:23.97,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Sounds nice!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.15,0:05:44.20,Main,Biwa,0,0,0,,A tiny Konoyozaru...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.91,0:05:45.66,Main,Biwa,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.41,0:05:50.16,Main,Ortiga,0,0,0,,Do you think putting the two of them together \N is making my Bowtzel even cuter?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.16,0:05:53.37,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi’s Metamon loves to Transform!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.92,0:05:56.42,Main,Meloco,0,0,0,,You’re awesome, kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.42,0:05:58.05,Main,Piña,0,0,0,,That’s the chillest!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.05,0:06:00.42,Main,Piña,0,0,0,,Join the parade, \N and you’ll be a surefire Star!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.42,0:06:01.55,Main,Them,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mm-hm, mm-hm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.55,0:06:03.93,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon in the parade?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.05,0:06:07.26,Main,Meloco,0,0,0,,You should join in, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.26,0:06:10.98,Main,Shuumei,0,0,0,,Mine hands shall \N create for thee{you} a costume.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.98,0:06:13.64,Main,Biwa,0,0,0,,Shuumei-kun’s an outfit-making {\i1}master!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.64,0:06:16.19,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yay! Let’s do it, Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Isn’t that nice, Navi?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.44,0:06:19.98,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I’ll take loads of photos!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.98,0:06:20.78,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.78,0:06:24.03,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,With that settled, \N better get straight to rehearsing and all!{dashi}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.03,0:06:25.16,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.91,0:06:29.91,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Ah, so that’s where you were.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.91,0:06:31.41,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ms. Raifort!{sensei}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.83,0:06:34.87,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Nemo mentioned that you’d arrived.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.50,0:06:37.79,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother, \N but have you got a moment?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.01,0:06:42.67,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.43,0:06:45.68,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,That’s awful...{hidoi}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.68,0:06:47.89,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,The field’s all messed up.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.89,0:06:48.93,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,That’s not all.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.76,0:06:51.02,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,A forest fire?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.81,0:06:54.06,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Awful stuff...{hidee}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.14,0:06:56.40,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Heavy snow?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.52,0:06:58.86,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,The road...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.57,0:07:04.61,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,As you see, strange things are happening \N in various spots around Paldea.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.61,0:07:07.66,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,One moment fields are drying up,{Just when you think that suddenly a field has dried up, a forest burns and an avalanche occurs in a place without snow.}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.66,0:07:11.58,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,{\q2}the next, a forest’s burning and there’s an avalanche \N somewhere it never even {\i1}snows.{\i0} 
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.58,0:07:13.70,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,It’s clearly irregular.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.21,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,But why...?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.21,0:07:16.83,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,These witness reports...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.58,0:07:21.05,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,They’re all concentrated \N around the edges of Paldea.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.71,0:07:24.05,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,There something out there?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.05,0:07:26.93,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,They’re all nearby the sealed shrines.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.93,0:07:28.43,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Sealed shrines?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.80,0:07:30.47,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Hundreds of years ago,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.10,0:07:36.60,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,in the Kingdom of Paldea’s heyday, \N shrines were built to seal disasters within.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.56,0:07:39.23,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Disasters?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.23,0:07:41.07,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,That sounds mega-crazy...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.65,0:07:45.32,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,It’s an old legend, \N but it still gives me a chill.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.90,0:07:49.45,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,I’d like you to investigate, \N to discover what’s behind this.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.45,0:07:51.78,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,If this gets any worse, \N it’ll be bad news.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.33,0:07:55.75,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Let’s all go and check it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.75,0:07:56.83,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.21,0:07:58.21,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.21,0:08:00.79,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Having you lot on the case \N is a huge relief.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.50,0:08:05.92,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,I’ll look into the disasters \N connected to the sealed shrines.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.47,0:08:07.63,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.38,0:08:10.22,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Shrines in four spots...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.80,0:08:12.56,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’ll be best if we split up.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.56,0:08:14.93,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Still, those’re pretty far away.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.93,0:08:17.44,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,{\i1}I’m{\i0} all set ‘cause \N I got my Kairyu, at least.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.81,0:08:19.65,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,And I can get there on Taikaiden.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.44,0:08:22.27,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,As for me and Liko...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.27,0:08:25.53,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,I’ll call you Ikirinko Taxis right away.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.53,0:08:27.53,Main,Liko Dot,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.22,0:08:52.26,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,Got all that.{All understood.} \N Navi’ll be fine; she’s with me.{I understand the story (you just told offscreen). Navi's with me, so she'll be fine.}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.26,0:08:53.68,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.68,0:08:55.97,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Work hard, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.97,0:08:58.10,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Go and have fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.24,0:09:14.66,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Right, then. \N I’ll leave it in your hands.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.66,0:09:15.62,Main,Liko Dot,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.62,0:09:18.37,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Awright! Let’s get flyin’, Kairyu!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.54,0:09:21.46,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Let’s go!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.04,0:09:23.38,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!{yoroshiku}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.67,0:09:29.55,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Ah! Oh right, you lot... \N One thing I forgot to say.{Not Friede's wording}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.13,0:09:33.51,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,There’re old stakes \N driven in near the shrines...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.51,0:09:34.76,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Stakes?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.10,0:09:38.43,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,But you must be very careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.81,0:09:42.23,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,If anyone were to ever \N pull them out without thinking...
Comment: 10,0:09:41.73,0:09:48.11,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Hrrrng! Hrrrrngh!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.61,0:09:53.36,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Awright! Finally yanked it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.53,0:09:56.37,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,So, just one left.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.12,0:09:56.37,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,{\an8}Man, I’m beat!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.37,0:09:57.62,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Sango!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.62,0:09:58.54,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.50,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,I wanna take a {\i1}break!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.50,0:10:01.91,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,The last one’s up next.
Comment: 10,0:10:02.00,0:10:03.37,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Grrr...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.56,0:10:21.35,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,This’s a total drag... Blah...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.35,0:10:24.44,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,We need funds \N if we’re to continue our journey.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.44,0:10:28.02,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} pull the next one, then! \N You made me do {\i1}all{\i0} of ‘em so far!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.40,0:10:30.73,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Because you lost \N at rock-paper-scissors.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.73,0:10:32.24,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Such a pain!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.61,0:10:35.78,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,What’s the point of \N pullin’ these things up, anyhow?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.78,0:10:41.29,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Search me. We just need to do \N as instructed, and then we’ll be paid.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.91,0:10:46.79,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Ugh... What a joke. The almighty Explorers, \N reduced to {\i1}part-timers.{\i0} {ALT: The almighty Explorers, reduced to working part-time jobs.}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.79,0:10:50.30,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,{\i1}Former{\i0} Explorers. \N We gave up that name.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.63,0:10:52.67,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.22,0:10:57.55,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Ooh, that looks ready to pop out.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.55,0:10:58.97,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Then be my guest.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.97,0:11:00.97,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,We {\i1}rock-paper-scissors{\i0} for it, right?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.97,0:11:01.93,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.31,0:11:12.57,Main,Sango Onyx,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors... shoot!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.03,0:11:14.95,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Rargh!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.32,0:11:18.95,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.95,0:11:22.95,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,You two. Is your investigation \N coming along smoothly?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.95,0:11:26.58,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Hey old-timer! \N You never told us it’d be {\i1}this{\i0} hard!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.00,0:11:30.17,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Is “old-timer” any way \N to address your employer?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.17,0:11:32.21,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Call me Hokkora, won’t you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.21,0:11:35.09,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. \N We’ll be finished soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.09,0:11:37.22,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Ooh! That’s the very thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.39,0:11:41.01,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.01,0:11:44.22,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,The stakes, driven into \N various points around Paldea...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.22,0:11:47.19,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,By researching their relative positions,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.19,0:11:50.81,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,I can delve deeper into \N the mysteries of the sealed shrines.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.28,0:11:57.28,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,At last, the fulfillment of \N my years-long dream as a historian{ is at hand}... {My dream of many years as a historian can finally...}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.28,0:12:01.24,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hrng! Hrng! Hrng!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.49,0:12:01.24,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.24,0:12:03.24,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.24,0:12:07.21,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,What am I {\i1}doing?{\i0} \N I’m pulling it out, duh!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.21,0:12:09.25,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Stop that! Halt!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.09,0:12:16.01,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,That’s the last one. \N The payment you agreed—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.01,0:12:20.47,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Hold it! \N Who told you to pull those out?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.47,0:12:21.01,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.64,0:12:23.51,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.93,0:12:29.52,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,I asked you to investigate \N {\i1}where{\i} the stakes were stuck in.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.31,0:12:33.27,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,We just... had to investigate them?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.27,0:12:37.28,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Whatcha mean? If something’s {\i1}stuck,{\i0} \N you gotta pull it out, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.78,0:12:42.28,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,When I heard you say this was the “last one,” \N you couldn’t {\i1}possibly{\i0} have meant that you...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.66,0:12:46.33,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Yes. Eight in each of the four areas, \N as you described.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.33,0:12:47.79,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,We pulled them all out.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.79,0:12:50.46,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,I can’t {\i1}believe{\i0} \N what I am hearing right now...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.46,0:12:55.42,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Have you just pulled out \N the stakes of the shrines?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.84,0:12:59.93,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Geez, you’re fussy!{you sure worry about the details} \N So what if we did?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.93,0:13:04.22,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Anyway, we apologize for the mistake.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.22,0:13:06.39,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,But we’ll be counting on that payment.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.39,0:13:07.52,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.52,0:13:11.81,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,It came from over there, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.81,0:13:12.81,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.23,0:13:15.52,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun! \N Time to go see!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.52,0:13:16.40,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.95,0:13:21.53,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.53,0:13:23.20,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,This cave doesn’t appear natural...{For a natural cave, it's... (too verb)}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.33,0:13:29.50,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Who’s there?
Comment: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:34.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.89,0:13:53.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,We met at some ruins just like these, \N didn’t we, Guren'arma?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.44,0:13:55.15,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It brings back memories!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.69,0:13:57.32,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Paldea...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.15,0:14:00.15,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I wonder what it was like back then.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.20,0:14:07.16,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Is this one of the stakes \N Ms. Raifort mentioned?{sensei}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.12,0:14:12.00,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,She said not to pull it out, \N but it’s {\i1}already{\i0} out...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.34,0:14:19.92,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Anyway, let’s go take a look.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.68,0:14:30.52,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The ground’s burnt...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.31,0:14:35.56,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s the direction of the forest fire.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.40,0:14:38.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The disaster...
Comment: 10,0:14:40.69,0:14:41.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.57,0:14:46.28,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,There’s nothing here.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.48,0:15:19.40,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Who’s there?{13:28}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.69,0:15:21.86,Main,Ult Sango,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.86,0:15:24.74,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,What’re the Rising Voltteccers \N doing here?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.74,0:15:27.24,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,That’s {\i1}my{\i0} line, Explorers!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.24,0:15:29.91,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You plottin’ something again?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.87,0:15:34.12,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Huh?! Straight to whining{complaining}, eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.12,0:15:35.41,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You’re so suspicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.41,0:15:37.21,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Rargh!{080} I’ll knock your lights out!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.21,0:15:38.38,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Just try me!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.38,0:15:39.71,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.71,0:15:42.13,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,The Explorers have disbanded.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.50,0:15:45.80,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,We’re just traveling, \N without any destination in mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.80,0:15:48.39,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,We’re only here \N to investigate the ruins.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.39,0:15:50.18,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Investigate the ruins?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.97,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,It’s a part-time job.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.47,0:15:54.89,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,We have no reason to fight you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.89,0:15:56.14,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Sango.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.14,0:15:58.23,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Hmph! Guess you get off easy!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.23,0:15:59.69,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Sango!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.15,0:16:04.15,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Again...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.15,0:16:05.86,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,That came from in there, yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.74,0:16:12.49,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,There somethin’ in there?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.60,0:16:40.10,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Why is there all this snow?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.20,0:16:51.41,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,What’s that?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.95,0:16:56.83,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,This is awful...{hidoi}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.42,0:17:02.38,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,A moving pile of leaves?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.67,0:17:08.80,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,A Pokémon?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.65,0:17:27.23,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What {\i1}is{\i0} that thing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.32,0:17:30.32,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,I’ve never seen that Pokemon before.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.32,0:17:31.82,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Meaning it’s totally rare?!{alt interpreting oni-rare as a JP phone game-style rarity: Meaning it’s a Total(ly) Rare?!}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.29,0:17:44.79,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,I dunno what’s goin’ on, but... \N Onipurin, go beat it up!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.55,0:17:56.39,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Ahh! Onipur—
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.39,0:17:58.31,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Sango!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.79,0:18:26.96,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on! \N What the heck {\i1}are{\i0} you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.96,0:18:31.38,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You got some guts, ignorin’ {\i1}me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.38,0:18:34.01,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yamirami! \N Use Power Gem on its feet!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.98,0:18:45.65,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It’s doin’ it again!{The (thing from) before is coming!}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.65,0:18:47.77,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yamirami, ride on Kairyu!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.48,0:18:53.61,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hah! Ground moves \N don’t work on Flying types!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.74,0:18:59.74,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whoa-oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.00,0:19:05.87,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yamirami!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.38,0:19:08.38,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Kairyu!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.26,0:19:24.10,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Trouble incoming, Wanival! Air Cutter!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.07,0:19:32.53,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.57,0:19:37.32,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival! Wave Tackle!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.00,0:19:48.17,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.01,0:20:00.47,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Don’t flinch, Loudbone! \N It’s obviously an Ice type!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.47,0:20:02.01,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We can’t lose the type match-up!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.02,0:20:07.14,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.94,0:20:13.94,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It didn’t melt! But why?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.32,0:20:17.95,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Loudbone!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.41,0:20:22.99,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Loudbone, hold on!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.88,0:20:36.84,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya, it’s okay.{Masquernya: It's a fish... But it's a fire type...}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.30,0:20:39.89,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Thanks, Guren'arma.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.10,0:20:51.10,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,If it uses Fire moves, \N then Guren'arma’s ability, Kindled Fire...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.61,0:20:57.07,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.11,0:20:59.70,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,No way, how come...?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.49,0:21:08.21,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya, calm down! \N Something’s wrong here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.59,0:21:20.76,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya! \N Let’s retreat for now!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.45,0:21:43.45,Main,Raifort,370,0,0,,The Calamity Pokémon...
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.70,0:21:48.41,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.41,0:21:51.87,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.46,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Bàojiàn!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.46,0:21:58.05,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,A Legendary Pokémon that controls snow.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.05,0:22:02.80,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Apparently, it originally took a different form, \N but do you know what form that was?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.18,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.52,0:23:42.40,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.40,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.49,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,B: A sword!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.86,0:23:50.49,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The story goes that the former sword snapped, \N and the halves became its left and right fangs.
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.38,0:24:03.42,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Argh, I’m totally mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.42,0:24:06.13,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,What’s with that guy, \N showing up outta nowhere?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.13,0:24:11.39,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,In total, four mystery Pokémon \N have appeared. It’s on the news.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.39,0:24:14.56,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Is this really the time to loaf around \N watching the news?! After it!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.56,0:24:15.93,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,It’s a disaster!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:15.93,0:24:16.85,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Old-timer!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.85,0:24:20.28,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,It’s {\i1}Hokkora!{\i0} \N If you don’t do something, this won’t end well!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.28,0:24:23.94,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.94,0:24:26.70,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Paldea in Calamity ―Charge
Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.70,0:24:29.86,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Just you wait, \N you totally rare Pokémon!{alt interpreting oni-rare as a JP phone game-style rarity: Just you wait, you Total(ly) Rare Pokémon!}
